# Read by BuildKit beside yidam/cluster/Dockerfile. The context is the repository root, and
# a checkout's build directories would otherwise be sent to the daemon before COPY runs.
**/target
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-*
.git
# The build context is the whole checkout, and the build stage copies all of it. An overlay's
# secret values must not reach an image layer.
yidam/cluster/overlays/*/objects/secrets
